{
  "id": "p09",
  "title": "The Seaside Radio",
  "titleZh": "海边广播站",
  "topic": "广播与小镇",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our little town looks quietly toward the wide, open sea.",
        "zh": "我们的小镇静静地朝着宽阔的大海。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the warm summer, the long, wide beach stays busy.",
        "zh": "温暖的夏天里，又长又宽的海滩一直很热闹。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In warm August, every long day feels bright and calm.",
        "zh": "在温暖的八月，每一个漫长的日子都明亮而平静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My old friend runs our small, busy broadcasting room today.",
        "zh": "我的老朋友今天经营着我们这间小小的广播室。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A clear message goes out to the whole wide public.",
        "zh": "一条清晰的消息传给了所有的公众。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We provide health news and simple advice each calm morning.",
        "zh": "每个平静的早晨，我们提供健康新闻和简单的建议。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A good story can describe a simple, quiet village life.",
        "zh": "一个好故事能描述一种简单安静的小镇生活。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She wants to direct a short film this coming year.",
        "zh": "她今年想导演一部短片。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The local police found a gun near the grey stone prison.",
        "zh": "当地警察在灰色的石砌监狱附近发现了一把枪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a young singer fails to appear on the stage today.",
        "zh": "于是，一位年轻歌手今天没能登上舞台。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Loyal fans wait outside to meet the young singer first.",
        "zh": "忠实的歌迷在外面等着，想第一个见到这位年轻歌手。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Next week she will move and try again with our help.",
        "zh": "下周她会搬走，并在我们的帮助下再试一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My strong signal fills the little computer with clear sound.",
        "zh": "我强劲的信号让那台小电脑里充满了清晰的声音。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A long, dark hair lies on the wooden kitchen table.",
        "zh": "一根又长又黑的头发落在木制厨房桌上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He takes a deep breath and slowly opens his mouth.",
        "zh": "他深吸一口气，慢慢张开了嘴。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A warm bowl of soup sits beside the front wooden door.",
        "zh": "一碗热汤放在前木门旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A solid wood shelf hangs above the small, tidy desk.",
        "zh": "一个结实的木架子挂在小而整洁的书桌上方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The fat cook orders a ton of fresh fish this morning.",
        "zh": "胖厨师今天早上订了一吨鲜鱼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My small golden prize is yours alone tonight.",
        "zh": "我这份小小的金奖今晚只属于你。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A pop concert fills the main hall with soft background music.",
        "zh": "一场流行音乐会伴着轻柔的背景音乐充满主厅。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later a slow brass band marches along the quiet street.",
        "zh": "后来，一支缓慢的铜管乐队沿着安静的街道行进。"
      },
      {
        "en": "None of us is entirely sure about the plan today.",
        "zh": "我们对这个计划今天会怎样都不太确定。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sudden storm looks terrible from this warm, safe room.",
        "zh": "一场突如其来的暴风雨从这间温暖安全的屋子里看去很可怕。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My daily work feels normal when we relax together.",
        "zh": "当我们一起放松时，我的日常工作感觉很正常。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I still remember the address from the distant past.",
        "zh": "我依然记得那个久远过去的地址。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We regard her as the one who manages everything here so well.",
        "zh": "我们把她看作那位把这里一切都管理得非常好的人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We give him a warm and friendly welcome today.",
        "zh": "今天我们给他一个温暖友好的欢迎。"
      },
      {
        "en": "What can you tell our many loyal listeners on air tonight?",
        "zh": "今晚你能在广播里告诉我们众多忠实的听众什么呢？"
      }
    ]
  ],
